Tooltip用を除く全てのフォントのサイズがデフォルトフォントのサ\n        イズと同じでなければならない。そうでないと再描画の際に問題が発生する。\n        名前にスペースや特殊文字を含むフォントを使う場合、名前をシングルクォー\n        トでくくる。このためシングルクォートを名前に含めることはできない。\n        例:  \n            :hi comment font='Monospace 10'\n```","ts":"1633953971.279900","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"a142397f-c5f0-405f-91cf-a0491d90f127","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":h highlight-font","ts":"1633953971.279800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vvkm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09b5092c-6d6d-4438-8cb2-0f48ddb68637","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"Gvim、ハイライトでフォント指定できた気がする\nたぶん一部環境でしか効かないけど","ts":"1633953761.279500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sBaMn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"148fe48a-6812-403d-bee1-bbc191c557d0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ハックなしでVimにnyan modeが欲しい","ts":"1633948947.277300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yuB28"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69c4e0eb-6bf0-4f21-8217-28d092e2023d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"テキストエディタにはいらんよなと思いつつも画像表示したい気持ちがある","ts":"1633948920.276600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UnYiC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b86b99bd-b5ed-4e32-8a33-feb71f4ecda6","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"そもそもキャラクタベースのUIなはずなのにNeovimだとポップアップの背景透過とかやり始めるのでヤバい","ts":"1633936586.275600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q+D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AE63AA33-042A-416B-BE93-3B6AF29C824C","type":"message","user":"UBDMG6N2J","text":"スプリットしたウィンドウでこの機能使った後にウィンドウのサイズ変更すると微妙に変になっていきます。。笑","ts":"1633935625.274800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_origin